#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0503 expect=violation domain=MH
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0503 (Condition: MIDSDTC present in dataset; Rule: MIDS present in dataset). MH carries MIDSDTC but no MIDS column -> the dataset-level presence check fires once, whatever the row values."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset MH class=EVENTS label="Medical History"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col MHSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col MHTERM  type=Char label="Reported Term for the Medical History"
col MHSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Medical History Event"
col MIDSDTC type=Char label="Disease Milestone Instance Date/Time"
---
S1 | MH | S1-001 | 1 | TYPE 2 DIABETES | 2019-03 | 2019-03-15
S1 | MH | S1-002 | 1 | HYPERTENSION    | 2018    |
